            "independent_review_state": "unreviewed",
            "supporting_text": "4.2 Serial Data Input, Output and IOs (DI, DO and IO0, IO1, IO2, IO3) The 25Q128JW supports standard SPI, Dual SPI and Quad SPI operation. Standard SPI instructions use the unidirectional DI (input) pin to serially write instructions, addresses or data to the device on the rising edge of the Serial Clock (CLK) input pin. Standard SPI also uses the unidirectional DO (output) to read data or status from the device on the falling edge of CLK."
          },
